# City sweep (city phase 11): sf-steep-lot-corner's keys on phase 11's export carry the skater head-on at
# 5 m/s into a building's inside corner (two walls at 90 degrees) on a gentle part of the lot below Upper
# Market, at tick 940. It stops dead and cannot turn or push out (left, then up, for seconds: under
# 2 cm/s); the ground is safe there, so the wedge rule does not stand it up. The same corner trap, between
# a curb face and the boundary wall, was the sweep's finding in Mission St, which the export now avoids
# with a curb cut at the wall; inside corners of buildings are everywhere, so this one is the sim's.
# Not run by check. Run it with `./skate run scenarios/city-sweep/building-inside-corner.skate`.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -1940 -1380 115.56 223
hold up+right 0..72
hold up+flip 72..114
hold up+flip 114..212
hold up+left 212..234
hold up+left 234..294
hold up+right+grab+slide 294..388
hold up+flip+grind 388..502
hold up 502..601
hold up+flip 601..691
hold up 691..750
hold up 750..771
hold left 771..801
hold up+right+grab 801..838
hold up 838..926
hold up+grind 926..971
hold left 975..1005
hold up 1005..1200
run 1200
